{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121805","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121805/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121805/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121805/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121805","id":4982069198,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKPRXzg","number":121805,"title":"`VectorWriteProxy` doubles `sizeof(Vector<T>)` from 8 to 16 bytes (on 64 bit builds)","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-26T18:59:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T10:12:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n`master`\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 24\n\n### Issue description\n\n`Vector<T>` contains an empty `VectorWriteProxy<T>` member before `CowData<T>`. The proxy and alignment padding increase `sizeof(Vector<T>)` from 8 to 16 bytes.\n\nSince `Vector<T>` is used extensively across the codebase, this padding is repeated in many places and partially reduces the benefit of keeping `CowData<T>` itself pointer-sized.\n\n\n---\nA possible way to reduce the overhead is to use [empty base optimization](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/ebo) by making `Vector<T>` inherit from `VectorWriteProxy<T>` and exposing it through a `VectorWriteProxy<T> &write() { return *this; }` method.\n\nThis would change calls from `vector.write[0]` to `vector.write()[0]` though.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd:\n```cpp\n// these all evaluate to true (on a 64-bit system)\nstatic_assert(sizeof(VectorWriteProxy<int>) == 1);\nstatic_assert(sizeof(CowData<int>) == sizeof(void *)); // 8\nstatic_assert(sizeof(Vector<int>) == sizeof(void *) * 2); // 16\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121805/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}